      "sourceLanguage": "en",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.022,
          "end": 3.18,
          "en": "(gentle music)",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.18,
          "end": 6.12,
          "en": "-: Now, let's have our own username/password.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.12,
          "end": 8.52,
          "en": "See, the problem is every time you're on this application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.52,
          "end": 9.6,
          "en": "you will get a new password.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.6,
          "end": 11.19,
          "en": "So, I've rerun this and you can see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 11.19,
          "end": 13.41,
          "en": "we have a password now, a new password.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 13.41,
          "end": 16.56,
          "en": "So, what if you can have your own username/password?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 16.56,
          "end": 18.03,
          "en": "And how do we configure that?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 18.03,
          "end": 19.26,
          "en": "So, it's actually very easy.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 19.26,
          "end": 20.4,
          "en": "What you can do is you can go",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 20.4,
          "end": 22.11,
          "en": "to your application or properties,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 22.11,
          "end": 24.99,
          "en": "and this is where you can specify the property.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 24.99,
          "end": 29.99,
          "en": "So, the property for username is spring.security.user.name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 30.09,
          "end": 33.24,
          "en": "By default this is user, but we don't want it to be user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 33.24,
          "end": 35.7,
          "en": "Let's say I want it to be telusko.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 35.7,
          "end": 37.5,
          "en": "And I have to set the password as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 37.5,
          "end": 38.94,
          "en": "So I have to say password.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 38.94,
          "end": 41.711,
          "en": "So here's your spring.security.user.password.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 41.711,
          "end": 42.913,
          "en": "And you can set any password.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 42.913,
          "end": 45.6,
          "en": "The most difficult one is 1234.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 45.6,
          "end": 46.65,
          "en": "Of course not recommended,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 46.65,
          "end": 48.763,
          "en": "but just to experiment with the application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 48.763,
          "end": 51.48,
          "en": "Let's have a password, which is 1234.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 51.48,
          "end": 52.86,
          "en": "There are a lot of drawbacks with this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 52.86,
          "end": 55.23,
          "en": "but we'll talk about drawbacks in some time.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 55.23,
          "end": 57.99,
          "en": "What I will do is I'll just save this and see if this works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 57.99,
          "end": 60.27,
          "en": "And every time you make a change in the properties,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 60.27,
          "end": 61.993,
          "en": "it's a good idea to restart your application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 61.993,
          "end": 65.04,
          "en": "and go back to your browser.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 65.04,
          "end": 67.02,
          "en": "And this time I will simply, first of all,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 67.02,
          "end": 68.82,
          "en": "I'm not sure if this is logged in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 68.82,
          "end": 70.68,
          "en": "I've restarted the application.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 70.68,
          "end": 74.19,
          "en": "So, let's log out. The session is already there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 74.19,
          "end": 77.31,
          "en": "So, I will say logout. Yes, done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 77.31,
          "end": 79.92,
          "en": "I don't need to use this element now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 79.92,
          "end": 82.2,
          "en": "And here I will just enter,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 82.2,
          "end": 84.06,
          "en": "okay, what's the username, which we were using?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 84.06,
          "end": 88.47,
          "en": "So username for me telusko and password is 1234.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 88.47,
          "end": 89.82,
          "en": "And when I click on sign in,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 89.82,
          "end": 92.37,
          "en": "okay, so we have to basically access the right page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 92.37,
          "end": 93.36,
          "en": "but it was logged in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 93.36,
          "end": 95.64,
          "en": "Enter, and you can see we got \"Hello World.\"",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 95.64,
          "end": 97.59,
          "en": "And I can also access the About now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 97.59,
          "end": 98.72999999999999,
          "en": "And it doesn't matter how many times",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 98.72999999999999,
          "end": 99.87,
          "en": "I shut the application now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 99.87,
          "end": 102.66,
          "en": "It will ask me for the username/password.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 102.66,
          "end": 105.47999999999999,
          "en": "And the username is telusko and the password is 1234.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 105.47999999999999,
          "end": 106.35,
          "en": "It is so easy, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 106.35,
          "end": 108.12,
          "en": "Now, what are the drawbacks of this?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 108.12,
          "end": 109.38,
          "en": "First of all, you are hardcording",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 109.38,
          "end": 110.91,
          "en": "the username/password, not a good idea.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 110.91,
          "end": 113.43,
          "en": "Having the password, like a plain text?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 113.43,
          "end": 115.86,
          "en": "Again, not a good idea. That's one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 115.86,
          "end": 117.949,
          "en": "Next, for the entire application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 117.949,
          "end": 120.69,
          "en": "you'll be having only one username/password.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 120.69,
          "end": 122.55,
          "en": "Imagine, when you build an application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 122.55,
          "end": 124.38,
          "en": "for your users or for your client,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 124.38,
          "end": 126.645,
          "en": "the client is sharing the username/password to everyone,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 126.645,
          "end": 127.83,
          "en": "the same one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 127.83,
          "end": 128.97,
          "en": "Not a good idea, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 128.97,
          "end": 130.68,
          "en": "So we want to have a different username/password",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 130.68,
          "end": 131.82,
          "en": "for the users.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 131.82,
          "end": 134.46,
          "en": "And maybe somewhere we have to store that in database.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 134.46,
          "end": 136.56,
          "en": "That's something we will be doing in the future.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 136.56,
          "end": 137.52,
          "en": "But at this point,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 137.52,
          "end": 139.07999999999998,
          "en": "this is the confidence of which we have done.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 139.07999999999998,
          "end": 140.28,
          "en": "Don't do that in production.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 140.28,
          "end": 141.69,
          "en": "It's only for the learning purpose.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 141.69,
          "end": 142.92000000000002,
          "en": "So yes, you can set the username,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 142.92000000000002,
          "end": 145.62,
          "en": "you can set the password like this in the property files.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 145.62,
          "end": 148.131,
          "en": "And now till this point, we are basically using,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 148.131,
          "end": 149.799,
          "en": "we were basically doing the login",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 149.799,
          "end": 151.77,
          "en": "with the help of login form, right?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 151.77,
          "end": 153.3,
          "en": "But what if you're building a RestAPI",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 153.3,
          "end": 155.69299999999998,
          "en": "and then you don't want to go for a login form?",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
